{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2008-reserva-1",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2008,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 1",
 "documento": "MAT-2008-RESERVA_1.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2008-reserva-1-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) las funciones definidas por \\(f(x)=x^2+ax+b\\) y \\(g(x)=c\\,e^{-(x+1)}\\). Se sabe que las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\) se cortan en el punto \\((-1,2)\\) y tienen en ese punto la misma recta tangente.",
    "apartados": [
     "(2 p.) Calcula los valores de \\(a\\), \\(b\\) y \\(c\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Halla la ecuación de dicha recta tangente."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Las gráficas pasan por </b>\\((-1,2)\\)<b>:</b></p>\\[g(-1)=c\\,e^0=c=2,\\qquad f(-1)=1-a+b=2\\]<p><b>Misma tangente en </b>\\(x=-1\\) (misma pendiente): \\(f'(x)=2x+a\\), \\(g'(x)=-c\\,e^{-(x+1)}\\).</p>\\[f'(-1)=-2+a=g'(-1)=-c=-2\\iff a=0\\]<p>Entonces \\(1-0+b=2\\iff b=1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=0\\), \\(b=1\\), \\(c=2\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[y-2=-2(x+1)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=-2x\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "a, b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2008-RESERVA_1.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2008-reserva-1-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Dadas las funciones \\(f:[0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) y \\(g:[0,+\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R\\) definidas por \\(f(x)=\\sqrt x\\) y \\(g(x)=\\sqrt[3]x\\), calcula el área del recinto limitado por las gráficas de \\(f\\) y \\(g\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Cortes:</b> \\(\\sqrt x=\\sqrt[3]x\\Rightarrow x^3=x^2\\) (elevando a 6) \\(\\iff x^2(x-1)=0\\iff x=0\\) o \\(x=1\\). En \\((0,1)\\) la raíz cúbica es mayor (en \\(x=\\frac18\\): \\(\\frac12\\gt\\frac1{\\sqrt8}\\)).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='48.9,163.4 50.7,137.8 52.5,131.2 54.3,126.5 56.1,122.8 57.9,119.7 59.7,116.9 61.5,114.5 63.3,112.2 65.1,110.2 66.9,108.3 68.8,106.5 70.6,104.8 72.4,103.2 74.2,101.7 76.0,100.3 77.8,98.9 79.6,97.6 81.4,96.3 83.2,95.1 85.0,93.9 86.8,92.8 88.6,91.7 90.4,90.6 92.2,89.6 94.0,88.6 95.8,87.6 97.6,86.6 99.4,85.7 101.2,84.8 103.1,83.9 104.9,83.0 106.7,82.1 108.5,81.3 110.3,80.5 112.1,79.7 113.9,78.9 115.7,78.1 117.5,77.4 119.3,76.6 121.1,75.9 122.9,75.1 124.7,74.4 126.5,73.7 128.3,73.0 130.1,72.4 131.9,71.7 133.8,71.0 135.6,70.4 137.4,69.7 139.2,69.1 141.0,68.5 142.8,67.9 144.6,67.3 146.4,66.7 148.2,66.1 150.0,65.5 151.8,64.9 153.6,64.3 155.4,63.8 157.2,63.2 159.0,62.6 160.8,62.1 162.6,61.5 164.4,61.0 166.2,60.5 168.1,60.0 169.9,59.4 171.7,58.9 173.5,58.4 175.3,57.9 177.1,57.4 178.9,56.9 180.7,56.4 182.5,55.9 184.3,55.5 186.1,55.0 187.9,54.5 189.7,54.0 191.5,53.6 193.3,53.1 193.3,53.1 191.5,53.8 189.7,54.5 187.9,55.2 186.1,55.9 184.3,56.6 182.5,57.3 180.7,58.0 178.9,58.8 177.1,59.5 175.3,60.2 173.5,61.0 171.7,61.7 169.9,62.5 168.1,63.2 166.2,64.0 164.4,64.8 162.6,65.5 160.8,66.3 159.0,67.1 157.2,67.9 155.4,68.7 153.6,69.5 151.8,70.3 150.0,71.1 148.2,72.0 146.4,72.8 144.6,73.6 142.8,74.5 141.0,75.3 139.2,76.2 137.4,77.1 135.6,78.0 133.8,78.9 131.9,79.8 130.1,80.7 128.3,81.6 126.5,82.5 124.7,83.5 122.9,84.5 121.1,85.4 119.3,86.4 117.5,87.4 115.7,88.4 113.9,89.4 112.1,90.5 110.3,91.5 108.5,92.6 106.7,93.7 104.9,94.8 103.1,95.9 101.2,97.0 99.4,98.2 97.6,99.3 95.8,100.5 94.0,101.8 92.2,103.0 90.4,104.3 88.6,105.6 86.8,106.9 85.0,108.3 83.2,109.7 81.4,11