  {
   "id": "matematicas-2008-reserva-1-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Los puntos \\(A(-2,3,1)\\), \\(B(2,-1,3)\\) y \\(C(0,1,-2)\\) son vértices consecutivos del paralelogramo \\(ABCD\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla las coordenadas del vértice \\(D\\).",
     "(1 p.) Encuentra la ecuación de la recta que pasa por \\(B\\) y es paralela a la diagonal \\(AC\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano que contiene a dicho paralelogramo."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>En el paralelogramo \\(ABCD\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\overrightarrow{BC}\\): \\(D=A+\\overrightarrow{BC}=(-2,3,1)+(-2,2,-5)\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(D(-4,5,-4)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AC}=(2,-2,-3)\\]<div class='res'>\\(r\\equiv(2+2t,\\ -1-2t,\\ 3-3t)\\), \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\vec n=\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\4&-4&2\\\\2&-2&-3\\end{vmatrix}=(16,\\,16,\\,0)\\parallel(1,1,0)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(x+y+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(A\\): \\(-2+3+D=0\\iff D=-1\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":45,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2,3,1],[2,-1,3],[0,1,-2],[-4,5,-4]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0.4,0.6,5.4],[3.6,-2.6,0.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,-2.6,0.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-2,3,1],[0,1,-2],\"#64748b\",1.3,true],[\"pt\",[-2,3,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,-1,3],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1,-2],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-4,5,-4],\"D\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m08r1a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m08r1a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m08r1a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m08r1a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='220.0,124.7 81.4,76.2 150.7,197.5 289.3,246.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='136.8' y1='18.0' x2='26.0' y2='134.4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='134.4' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='220.0' y1='124.7' x2='150.7' y2='197.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.3' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='220.0' cy='124.7' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='227.0' y='118.7' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='81.4' cy='76.2' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='88.4' y='70.2' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='150.7' cy='197.5' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='157.7' y='191.5' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='289.3' cy='246.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='296.3' y='240.0' font-weight='700'>D</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.7' y2='271.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='5.7' y='276.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='271.6' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='276.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='254.2' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='252.6' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(x+y-1=0\\)</div></div>"
